---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: authorized
    q_check_published --> q_check_not_supplied: results published
    q_check_published --> q_revert_not_published: results not yet published
    q_revert_not_published --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_calculate_fees: tokens not yet supplied
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: already supplied
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_calculate_fees --> q_transfer_tokens: calculate tokenAmount = totalAllocatedTokens + feeAmount
    q_transfer_tokens --> q_transfer_fees: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), tokenAmount)
    q_transfer_fees --> q_update_state: transfer fee portion to Legion fee receiver
    q_update_state --> q_emit: tokensSupplied = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokensSupplied(totalAllocatedTokens, feeAmount)

    note right of q_calculate_fees
        INV-001: Tokens can only be supplied after results publication
        INV-002: Token supply includes allocated tokens plus fees
        INV-003: Fee is transferred to Legion fee receiver
        INV-004: Only projectAdmin can supply tokens
    end note
